2026-10-09T20:45:26.8458112Z [org.jetbrains.intellij.platform] Patching plugin.xml: value of 'change-notes[
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8497776Z         <b>0.4.29 / 0.4.30</b> — fix: <b>"Configure LLM" now pre-fills your config</b>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8499526Z         — no more re-typing model+key. The wizard pre-fills your current model, base
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8501369Z         URL and vision model, pre-selects your current provider (✓ 当前), and lets you
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8502042Z         <b>leave the API key blank to keep the stored one</b> (only required when there's
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8502753Z         no key yet or you switch providers). The config itself was never lost — it lives
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8503335Z         in <code>~/.chainlesschain/config.json</code> and survives CLI updates; the
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8504084Z         wizard just didn't pre-fill it. (Mirrors the VS Code 0.34.0 fix. 0.4.30 adds
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8507338Z         this very change-note, which 0.4.29 omitted.)
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8507808Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8508615Z         <b>0.4.28</b> — docs: the Marketplace "What's New" now lists every release
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8509721Z         (it had silently stopped at 0.4.19 — change-notes are no longer missed).
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8510631Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8511219Z         <b>0.4.27</b> — cleared the 2 deprecated-API usages the Marketplace verifier
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8511955Z         flagged (now <code>URI.toURL()</code> + a combo-box dialog), so the plugin
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8512481Z         stays compatible with future IntelliJ releases.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8513383Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8514333Z         <b>0.4.26</b> — fix: no more false "未检测到 cc CLI" when <code>cc</code> IS
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8515436Z         installed. The version probe timeout went 5s → 12s (cold starts), and since
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8520294Z         <code>cc</code> is also the C compiler's name, the plugin now resolves the
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8521308Z         binary with fallback (<code>cc → chainlesschain → clc → clchain</code>) and
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8539173Z         uses it for the chat spawn and every probe.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8539625Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8540253Z         <b>0.4.25</b> — the agent can actually ask you a question:
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8547696Z         <code>ask_user_question</code> now pops a dialog (single-choice / multi-select
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8548931Z         checkboxes / free-text input) so the agent can clarify instead of guessing.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8551269Z         Requires <code>cc</code> ≥ 0.162.95.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8552644Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8553293Z         <b>0.4.24</b> — fix: a graceful "couldn't ask in the panel" degradation no
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8553943Z         longer renders as a scary <b>✗ ask_user_question</b> failure.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8554462Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8555565Z         <b>0.4.23</b> — new <b>⚙ LLM → 检查 cc 更新…</b> menu item (check on demand),
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8556432Z         plus a clear hint when the <code>cc</code> CLI isn't installed.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8567722Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8570636Z         <b>0.4.22</b> — you're now told when a newer <code>cc</code> CLI is published
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8572261Z         on npm, so you don't silently miss new features.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8573060Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8575013Z         <b>0.4.21</b> — fix: reconfiguring the LLM now restarts the running chat so it
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8576343Z         picks up the new provider/model/key (no more "配置完还没用 / 新开对话才行").
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8578930Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8590981Z         <b>0.4.20</b> — new <code>/review</code> command: review your uncommitted git
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8591963Z         diff right from the chat (matches the VS Code panel).
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8592516Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8596688Z         <b>0.4.19</b> — fix: the suggested vision model now matches the CLI's
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8600077Z         actual default (<code>doubao-seed-2-0-lite-260215</code>) instead of an
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8607611Z         older snapshot, so the prefilled value equals what
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8608248Z         <code>cc agent --image</code> uses.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8611100Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8618546Z         <b>0.4.18</b> — dedicated image-recognition (vision) model entry: the
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8619215Z         <b>⚙ LLM</b> button is now a small menu (configure full LLM <i>or</i> just
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8623372Z         the vision model), plus a <b>Tools → Configure Vision Model</b> action.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8627035Z         Set <code>llm.visionModel</code> without re-running the whole wizard or
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8627706Z         re-typing your API key; blank reverts to the text model.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8630696Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8638567Z         <b>0.4.17</b> — first-run nudge: when no LLM provider is configured yet,
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8651924Z         the chat panel now shows a dim hint pointing at the <b>⚙ LLM</b> button
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8652532Z         instead of staying blank until the first turn fails with a 401 (VS Code
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8667352Z         onboarding parity).
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8671909Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8678207Z         <b>0.4.16</b> — chat panel LLM UX: (1) paste screenshots — Ctrl/Cmd+V an
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8692758Z         image to attach it to your next message (vision); (2) a <b>⚙ LLM</b>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8700448Z         quick-entry button by Send opens the provider/model wizard, and auth
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8716636Z         failures (401/403/missing key) now hint at it; (3) the wizard can set a
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8722571Z         separate <b>image-recognition (vision) model</b> — text and vision models
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8728002Z         no longer have to be the same.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8729024Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8729613Z         <b>0.4.15</b> — multi-line chat composer: the input now wraps across
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8730388Z         lines — <b>Enter</b> sends, <b>Shift+Enter</b> adds a newline (VS Code
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8730888Z         parity).
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8731089Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8731758Z         <b>0.4.14</b> — extended-thinking reasoning (with <code>/think</code>) now
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8732715Z         streams into the transcript dimmed/italic, set apart from the answer
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8733080Z         (VS Code parity).
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8733286Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8734114Z         <b>0.4.13</b> — Markdown rendering in the chat transcript: fenced/inline
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8734586Z         <code>code</code> (monospace) and <b>bold</b> now render instead of raw
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8735264Z         markers (VS Code parity). Streaming stays plain, then snaps to styled.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8741735Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8742273Z         <b>0.4.12</b> — "Fix with ChainlessChain" intention: on an error/warning
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8742804Z         line, Alt+Enter offers a quick-fix that seeds the chat with a fix request
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8743244Z         scoped to that file + those problems (VS Code parity).
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8743541Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8744067Z         <b>0.4.11</b> — slash-command autocomplete: typing <code>/</code> at the
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8744520Z         start of the chat input pops a chooser of the panel's commands
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8745028Z         (<code>/new</code>, <code>/compact</code>, <code>/think</code>, …),
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8745417Z         filtered as you type (VS Code parity).
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8745677Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8746303Z         <b>0.4.10</b> — fix: wrap the diff-review document reads
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8746756Z         (<code>openDiff</code>/<code>openMultiDiff</code>) in a read action.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8747227Z         Since 2026.2 the EDT no longer grants implicit read access, so building
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8747697Z         the diff threw "Read access is allowed from inside read-action only" on
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8748083Z         2026.2+. No behavior change on 2025.x.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8748331Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8748820Z         <b>0.4.9</b> — fix: the chat tool window now deterministically uses the
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8749288Z         LLM provider you configured (<code>cc config</code> / Configure LLM),
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8749757Z         reading <code>~/.chainlesschain/config.json</code> and passing it
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8750253Z         explicitly to <code>cc agent</code> — no more spurious
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8750683Z         <code>Anthropic error: 401</code> when another provider is configured.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8751022Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8751452Z         <b>0.4.8</b> — <code>/compact</code> in the chat tool window (Claude-Code
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8751930Z         IDE parity): trims the live conversation history between turns (no extra
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8752395Z         LLM call) and reports the tokens saved. Mirrors the VS Code 0.31.0
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8752721Z         feature.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8752895Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8753261Z         <b>0.4.7</b> — cleared the remaining API-compatibility flags the Plugin
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8753744Z         Verifier reported on 2026.x: the @-mention list renderer no longer uses a
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8754252Z         scheduled-for-removal helper, and the deprecated terminal customizer was
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8754775Z         removed (a <code>cc</code> you run in a terminal still auto-connects via the
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8755161Z         bridge's discovery lockfile).
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8755395Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8755827Z         <b>0.4.6</b> — newer-IDE compatibility: removed the last deprecated-API
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8756342Z         usages (terminal-process listener + provider-chooser dialog). Plugin Verifier
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8756885Z         reports no internal / scheduled-for-removal / deprecated API usage on 2025.2.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8757251Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8757654Z         <b>0.4.5</b> — reverted the experimental 0.4.4 <code>getTerminalOutput</code>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8758155Z         tool: the terminal API it used is not stable across IDE versions and caused
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8758621Z         errors on some builds. Everything else is unchanged from 0.4.3.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8758946Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8759772Z         <b>0.4.3</b> — the <code>@</code>-mention symbol completion now covers
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8760289Z         <b>methods/functions</b> too (not just classes) — type a method name to
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8760677Z         reference the file where it's defined.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8760926Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8761488Z         <b>0.4.2</b> — the <code>@</code>-mention popup now includes project class
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8761978Z         symbols (type a class name to reference the file where it's defined),
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8762450Z         alongside <code>@selection</code>/<code>@diagnostics</code> and files.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8762788Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8763223Z         <b>0.4.1</b> — expanded the plugin description / what's-new (no functional
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8763574Z         change since 0.4.0).
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8763779Z         <br/><br/>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8764436Z         <b>0.4.0</b> — VS Code feature parity.
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8764715Z         <ul>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8765077Z           <li>Multi-conversation <b>tabs</b> (one agent per tab, resume across restarts).</li>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8765956Z           <li><b>Approval modes</b> (<code>/auto</code>·<code>/bypass</code>·<code>/normal</code>)
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8767054Z               and <b>extended thinking</b> (<code>/think</code>·<code>/ultrathink</code>·<code>/think-off</code>),
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8767667Z               plus <code>/new</code> <code>/stop</code> <code>/cost</code> <code>/context</code>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8768161Z               <code>/plan</code> <code>/approve</code> <code>/reject</code>.</li>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8768647Z           <li><b>Interactive plan &amp; approval cards</b> (Approve/Deny buttons).</li>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8769153Z           <li>Editor <b>Explain / Refactor</b> actions, <code>@file#L</code> reference
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8769681Z               insertion (<code>Ctrl/Cmd+Alt+K</code>), and an <code>@</code>-mention popup.</li>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8771340Z           <li>Native diff "<b>Request changes…</b>" with inline notes, and batch
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8771791Z               <b>openMultiDiff</b> multi-file review.</li>
2026-10-09T20:45:26.8772169Z           <li><b>In-editor app preview</b> (JCEF) with Start/Stop.</li>
